  "bodyHash": "98d7f2d42243012c",
  "content": "\n\n<p>泰拉瑞亞的結構終於要來到了我的世界。我盡力讓它們盡可能地融入我的世界。</p>\n<p>許多結構都擁有隨機生成的房間，就像在泰拉瑞亞中一樣。</p>\n<p>這些結構的戰利品與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terra-curio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terra Curio</a>（未來可能還會支援更多模組）相容，且結構本身能與所有生物群系模組相容。</p>\n<p>如果你對一個深受泰拉瑞亞啟發的整合包感興趣，在這個整合包中你需要擊敗首領來解鎖新礦脈、敵怪生成甚至像泰拉瑞亞一樣的 NPC，請查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/prodigium-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prodigium Reforged！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組才剛起步，以下是目前的結構列表：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fNms7TH/overworld.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">生命之樹：</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>生成於平原與森林類型的生物群系中，是一棵擁有深層根系的大樹。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_2bf32aa8-dd98-4a48-989e-83e43f008b84.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"772\" height=\"415\"></p>\n<p>隨機根系的範例：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_5e0eaa5a-5f1f-4a18-a5b7-496123c50ef8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">地下小木屋：</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>生成於地下，共有三種大小（小型、中型、大型）。目前已有兩種變體：預設小木屋與冰霜小木屋（更多即將推出）。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>這是小型變體的樣子（大型變體就留給大家自行探索吧！）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_7f89ebb3-29ad-4721-8702-3863c2063283.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_faf3fe83-6b1f-4ddf-b034-e6f82fc0428c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p>其他小型變體：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_73bbc0e3-68cc-43bf-9742-600a5c0ebafe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_09376f2d-3b27-41d2-b80a-1974206cc591.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_9ab33beb-c60f-4a1e-ab1b-08addcae01e6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/025TmZ4/nether.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>廢墟小屋：</strong></span></h3>\n<p>在地獄中生成，內部包含多個隨機生成的房間。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_7ecbd50b-a62e-414c-acfa-073e0c012974.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1071663/description_37ee74a1-cb2e-45b8-9a54-9cf412072d19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mqX84Bm/road-map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p>我已經列出了對現有結構的改進計畫，以及接下來要新增的結構清單。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>未來結構：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">即將推出：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>深板岩小木屋（優先級 1）</li>\n<li>優化戰利品表</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">稍後推出：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>浮空島</li>\n<li>叢林神殿</li>\n<li>地牢</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>待改進項目：</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>整體戰利品表優化</li>\n<li>增加與更多模組的相容性（例如 Extractinator + 其他模組？）</li>\n<li>改善生命之樹本身（更好的葉子與隨機樹枝生成）</li>\n<li>新增廢墟小屋房間</li>\n<li>新增生命之樹房間</li>\n<li>優化小木屋生成機制（目前非優先項目，但一定會實作）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fPRODIGIUM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3W9rfff/ssdara.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"166\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（開放原始碼的 GitHub 倉庫即將推出）</p>",
